{"version":"1","id":"thsottiaux","handle":"thsottiaux","name":"Tibo","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/a533a1477d60492aa6a46cb86195b219","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":9.6003,"y":-0.7198,"cluster_id":0,"posts_collected":120,"newest_post_at":"2026-05-03T22:11:38.000Z","oldest_post_at":"2026-02-17T23:30:44.000Z","features":{"hype_score":0.091667,"listicle_ratio":0.0,"question_ratio":0.083333,"avg_read_time":0.0,"summary_length_avg":218.478632,"title_length_avg":200.341667,"title_length_var":16899.124931,"tag_entropy":2.297043,"tag_diversity":0.166667,"top_tag_share":0.008333,"avg_upvotes":0.025,"median_upvotes":0.0,"avg_comments":0.0,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.25,"zero_engagement_share":0.975,"viral_share":0.0,"posts_per_week":11.208209,"non_article_ratio":0.991667,"author_present_share":0.0,"recency_skew":120.0},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[-8.9265,-9.3382],"cadence_depth":[0.7647,-9.8235],"hype_variety":[9.3676,-7.8382],"title_style":[8.1618,-8.0294]},"top_tags":[["codex",21],["openai",15],["ai-assisted-development",12],["ai-coding",4],["gpt",4],["ai-agents",3],["cloud",2],["llm",2]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["We are adding compute as fast as we can for Codex, but demand is surging faster than anticipated and service can be a little bit choppy for some. Team is working hard behind the scenes.","Codex has been open source from the beginning, and today I am proud that we are able to do more for the community out there. Let's keep building https://t.co/x8NTfJcMr9","RT @OpenAIDevs: We're introducing Codex Security.\n\nAn application security agent that helps you secure your codebase by finding vulnerabili\u2026"],"outlier":["We will ship again this week. Codex has achieved escape velocity and will keep improving rapidly."]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"cIu3vYGzn","title":"What are we obviously not getting right with Codex?","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2051062151805382956","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-are-we-obviously-not-getting-right-with-codex--ciu3vygzn","summary":"A community-facing question from the Codex team asking developers what they are obviously getting wrong with the product. This appears to be an open solicitation for feedback and criticism to help improve Codex, OpenAI's AI coding tool.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-03T22:11:38.000Z"},{"id":"1LNIsiXM3","title":"Last week, we released *Auto-Review* mode in Codex! It is now the default within OpenAI and reduces amount of approvals needed by ~200X. Amazing work from our alignment team.\n\nRead the blog at","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2050989326570532919","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/last-week-we-released-auto-review-mode-in-codex-it-is-now-the-default-within-openai-and-reduces--1lnisixm3","summary":"OpenAI released Auto-Review mode in Codex, which is now the default within OpenAI. The feature reduces the number of approvals needed by approximately 200x, credited to work from their alignment team.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--2-1xRawN--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2011","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-03T17:22:15.000Z"},{"id":"0LKMrt4Q5","title":"/goal might be the most consequential thing we have shipped in codex\n\nThe value of good instructions has never been higher.","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2050811900062286168","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/goal-might-be-the-most-consequential-thing-we-have-shipped-in-codex-the-value-of-good-instructions-0lkmrt4q5","summary":"OpenAI's Codex has shipped a new /goal feature, described as potentially the most impactful addition to the tool yet. The post emphasizes that the quality of instructions given to AI coding agents is increasingly critical, positioning /goal as a way to provide high-level direction that shapes agent behavior throughout a session.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--foaA6JGU--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2004","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-03T05:37:13.000Z"},{"id":"cb4XunnqM","title":"It's also become super good after all the @steipete cooking over the last week or so. I've had the best experience with GPT-5.5 so far, it's night and day compared to two weeks ago.","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2050395190847066270","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/it-s-also-become-super-good-after-all-the-steipete-cooking-over-the-last-week-or-so-i-ve-had-the-b-cb4xunnqm","summary":"A brief social media post praising GPT-5.5's recent improvements, describing the experience as dramatically better compared to two weeks prior, crediting recent tuning work.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--1KxV4ohY--/f_auto/v1722860400/public/Placeholder%2007","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-02T02:01:22.000Z"},{"id":"9ZrUy2RaQ","title":"You can now keep codex going for days. \n\nWith GPT-5.5 it will build an entire OS kernel for you if you ask, or find critical bugs in a codebase, or optimize your database schemas, or\u2026 the options are endless.","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2049970070873629026","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/you-can-now-keep-codex-going-for-days-with-gpt-5-5-it-will-build-an-entire-os-kernel-for-you-if-y-9zruy2raq","summary":"OpenAI's Codex can now run continuously for extended periods, enabling long-running autonomous coding tasks powered by GPT-5.5. Use cases include building OS kernels, finding critical bugs in codebases, and optimizing database schemas.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--0_ODbtD2--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2008","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T21:52:06.000Z"},{"id":"4UkSVBcSv","title":"RT @AriX: Computer Use runs this use case 42% faster in today's Codex app update.","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2049957827150746107","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/rt-arix-computer-use-runs-this-use-case-42-faster-in-today-s-codex-app-update--4uksvbcsv","summary":"Codex app update improves Computer Use performance by 42% for a specific use case, as noted in a retweet announcement.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T21:03:27.000Z"},{"id":"DevgadkxT","title":"This thing does more than what you think it does. Codex now available for non-coders","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2049933460756979719","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/this-thing-does-more-than-what-you-think-it-does-codex-now-available-for-non-coders-devgadkxt","summary":"OpenAI Codex is expanding its availability beyond developers to non-coders, suggesting the tool has broader use cases than just writing code. The post highlights that Codex can be used by people without programming backgrounds, positioning it as a more general-purpose AI assistant.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--P4t4XyoV--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2001","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T19:26:37.000Z"},{"id":"2o5a0MW6e","title":"Lots of improvements across the board both for coders and general work. Update your codex app to enjoy all the improvements.\n\nWe will be back next week","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2049930525994066327","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/lots-of-improvements-across-the-board-both-for-coders-and-general-work-update-your-codex-app-to-enj-2o5a0mw6e","summary":"A general announcement about improvements to the Codex app covering both coding and general productivity use cases, with a prompt to update the app to receive the latest changes.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ZrL_HSsR--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2006","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T19:14:57.000Z"},{"id":"cF65Z1OrB","title":"Send us feature requests for codex in the form of an images 2.0 generated image. It makes it easier for codex to implement if we decide to go for it. Saw some good ones today already that codex is cooking on.","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2049710850882380004","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/send-us-feature-requests-for-codex-in-the-form-of-an-images-2-0-generated-image-it-makes-it-easier--cf65z1orb","summary":"OpenAI is encouraging users to submit feature requests for Codex as images generated with Images 2.0, suggesting this format makes it easier for Codex to implement requested features. The team has already received promising submissions they are working on.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--2-1xRawN--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2011","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T04:42:03.000Z"},{"id":"PHXMRENk8","title":"With some small tweaks, Codex can work for days on hard tasks. We will release some changes to make this easier to use for everyone. \n\nWhat\u2019s the hardest task you\u2019ve seen GPT-5.5 succeed at?","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2049362299392241784","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/with-some-small-tweaks-codex-can-work-for-days-on-hard-tasks-we-will-release-some-changes-to-make--phxmrenk8","summary":"OpenAI hints that Codex, their AI coding agent, can be configured to work on hard tasks for days at a time. They plan to release changes to make this extended autonomous operation easier for all users, and are soliciting examples of the hardest tasks GPT-5.5 has succeeded at.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-29T05:37:02.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["beyang","antirez","thdxr","lovable","ryancarson"],"opposit